Permit2ClaimPolicy::getTokenInWhitelist
├── given policy is not initialized
│   └── it should return empty array
├── given single token is whitelisted
│   └── it should return array with one token
├── given multiple tokens are whitelisted
│   └── it should return array with all tokens
├── given chainId has no tokens configured
│   └── it should return empty array
└── given different accounts
    └── it should isolate storage per account